---
import GitHubContributions from "../components/GitHubContributions.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Pill from "../components/Pill.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Abdul Kareem"
  description="Abdul Kareem is a software engineering student at COMSATS in Lahore and a freelance developer who builds full-stack TypeScript apps, umpires cricket and cares about typefaces."
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">
        I'm Abdul Kareem, a software engineering student at COMSATS in Lahore
        and a freelance developer the rest of the time. I build full-stack
        TypeScript apps, run my own servers behind <Pill
          hue="blue"
          size="inline"
          icon="🖥️">Caddy</Pill
        >, and keep more notes than any one person reasonably should.
      </p>

      <p>
        Most weeks are split between client work (an ecommerce platform for a
        handmade jewelry brand), <Pill
          hue="blue"
          size="inline"
          href="https://getcursus.cc"
          external>Cursus</Pill
        > (the attendance tracker I built because I needed one, which a handful of
        classmates now use too), and seven courses I'm determined to get A's in, Algorithms
        retake included.
      </p>

      <p>
        Off the keyboard, I <Pill hue="orange" size="inline" icon="🏏"
          >umpire cricket matches</Pill
        > and watch far too much cricket and football. I play chess on <Pill
          hue="yellow"
          size="inline"
          icon="♟️"
          href="https://lichess.org/@/Abdul_Kareem1"
          external>Lichess</Pill
        > with mixed results. I've been lifting for four months, chasing a <Pill
          hue="green"
          size="inline"
          icon="🏋️"
          href="/training">100 kg bench</Pill
        > and dodging bicep curls wherever possible. I've also quit sugar, doodh soda
        included, which anyone from Lahore will understand is a real sacrifice.
      </p>

      <p>
        I care about typefaces more than is probably healthy. Every font here
        was picked on purpose; <Pill
          hue="rose"
          size="inline"
          href="/colophon"
          after=" explains why.">the colophon</Pill
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <GitHubContributions username="abdulkareemakn" />
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4667rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    font-size: 1.1333rem;
    line-height: 1.7647;
  }

  .prose .lead {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.5238;
  }
</style>
